 <h3><u>Aagaya shabaan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Marhaba..<br> Marhaba swalle a'laa<br> Aagaya shaban khushiyo'n ke zamane aagaye<br> Rone wale mehfilo'n mein muskurane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Kaun aaya hai zamee'n par banke zeenat baap ki<br> panjetan khud shauk mein jhoola jhulane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Pyaas bachpan mein bujhakar sheh ki ghazi ne kaha<br> dekhiye baba hame waade nibhane aagaye</p> 
  <p>May alam lekar chala to aayi ghazi ki sadaa<br> ho mubarak ab tumhe baazu katane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Dekhne sidra se aagey ke manazir jibra'eel<br> Fatema Zehra ke ghar chakki chalane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Shikwa qismat se na karna jaun se bole Husain<br> ab to raazi hai tujhe hum khud manane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Qabr me pohcha jo momin aayi baali se sadaa<br> aye farishto'n jao kyu isko jagane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Mai ne likkha tha fidak ki maalika tujhko salaam<br> ghaar mein kuch log mera ghar jalane aagaye</p> 
  <p>Dekhkar manzar najaf se karbala tak yu laga<br> jaise qayam ki hukumat ke zamaney aagaye</p> 
  <p>Is jaha'n mein aye takallum hum faqeer e buturab<br> dushman e zehra ko mitti mein milane aagaye<br> Marhabaa swalle a'laa</p> 
